  "question": {
    "text": "The correct molecular orbital diagram for <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;molecule in the ground state is",
