  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>The electronic configuration of fluorine atom is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>2</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>2</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mn>5</mn></msup></math>. The fluorine molecule has <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>18</mn></math>&nbsp;electrons. The <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi></math> mixing occurs when the <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></math>&nbsp;and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi></math>&nbsp;orbitals have similar energies. The energy difference between <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mtext>and</mtext><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi></math> orbitals in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mtext>and</mtext><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>Ne</mi></math> is greater than that in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Li</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>Be</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mtext>and</mtext><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></math>. Hence, the molecular orbital electronic configuration of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#963;</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#963;</mi><mo>*</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#963;</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#963;</mi><mo>*</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#963;</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi></msub><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></msub><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></msub><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mo>*</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></msub><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mo>*</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></msub><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#963;</mi><mo>*</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi></msub></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_advanced/261d2b34-4d79-4a0e-baad-f38e2ea2cb0c.png\" style=\"width: 693px; height: 460px;\" /></p></blockquote>",
